      "message": "I mean these 2 points:\n\n1) https://source.corp.google.com/h/chromium/build/+/main:siso/subcmd/collector/receiver.go;drc\u003d74388365bb4dfcf54da57e140b8556482519a8fc;l\u003d28\n2) https://source.corp.google.com/h/chromium/build/+/main:siso/subcmd/ninja/o11y.go;drc\u003d5092824a6a0b5ce06cd8e772bd2a89bd93d6c449;l\u003d193\n\nFirst expects path without unix://, and the second expects unix:// to be present.",
      "parentUuid": "de14eb4e_353e4d44",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 148,
